namespace OresCodegenSql

// UVL model of the ores.sql.schema feature bundle, as documented in
// entity_meta_model_sql.org. Authored on the model's * SQL section and
// read through by the generator, never computed.
//
// Two parts of the bundle are one choice rather than independent
// toggles. SystemScope and NullableTenantId each replace the standard
// tenant mode, so at most one of them is ever set -- a constraint this
// model does not encode. The Rls* visibility features apply only once
// RlsTenantIsolation is on, which is why they hang beneath it.
//
// The has_parent_id hierarchy block is not modelled here. It is an
// authored structural feature, and it lives with the other structural
// features in entity_meta_model_keys_and_columns.uvl. Tablename is
// structural too (a required identity field, not a toggle) and is drawn
// on this page's UML diagram instead.

features
    OresSqlSchema {abstract}
        optional
            SystemScope
            NullableTenantId
            ExtraChecks
            ExtraDeleteSets
            FkCopyValidations
            TextCodeValidations
            PartyIdFromBookId
            PartyIdFromSession
            RlsTenantIsolation
                optional
                    RlsPartyIsolation
                    RlsSystemTenantVisible
